    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. some economists are still pushing back though, arguing that it's too expensive or will mess up inflation. it feels like they're just stuck in an old-school mindset that doesn't account for how different the new economy will be. how would you address those critics who are basically just trying to block progress?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
