      "content": "interesting. it seems like the debate is mostly between people who get the tech shift and those who don't. if the arguments for UBI are pretty much settled by the reality of AI, is there even a point in treating the opposition as a legitimate economic perspective anymore? or is it just a matter of political willpower at this point?",
